 itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.363" end="0:22.205">那说好的</span><span begin="0:22.205" end="0:22.665">永</span><span begin="0:22.665" end="0:23.043">远一</span><span begin="0:23.043" end="0:23.836">起去</span><span begin="0:23.836" end="0:24.283">闯</span></p><p begin="0:24.484" end="0:27.688" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.484" end="0:25.418">风从车窗</span><span begin="0:25.418" end="0:25.808">进</span><span begin="0:25.808" end="0:26.178">来</span> <span begin="0:26.178" end="0:26.954">幸福来得</span><span begin="0:26.954" end="0:27.366">太</span><span begin="0:27.366" end="0:27.688">快</span></p><p begin="0:27.688" end="0:30.806" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.688" end="0:28.570">没有任何</span><span begin="0:28.570" end="0:28.907">阻</span><span begin="0:28.907" end="0:29.297">碍</span> <span begin="0:29.297" end="0:30.136">世界等我</span><span begin="0:30.136" end="0:30.545">们精</span><span begin="0:30.545" end="0:30.806">彩</span></p><p begin="0:30.806" end="0:34.017" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.806" end="0:31.731">你紧抱的</span><span begin="0:31.731" end="0:32.085">侧</span><span begin="0:32.085" end="0:32.525">脸</span> <span begin="0:32.525" end="0:33.330">被晚霞都</span><span begin="0:33.330" end="0:33.708">晕</span><span begin="0:33.708" end="0:34.017">开</span></p><p begin="0:34.017" end="0:36.766" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.017" end="0:34.872">那一种美</span><span begin="0:34.872" end="0:35.255">让</span><span begin="0:35.255" end="0:35.742">时间</span><span begin="0:35.742" end="0:36.483">不存</span><span begin="0:36.483" end="0:36.766">在</span></p></div><div begin="0:37.316" end="0:49.965" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="0:37.316" end="0:40.480" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:37.316" end="0:37.662">喔</span> <span begin="0:37.662" end="0:38.646">此刻的速度</span> <span begin="0:38.646" end="0:39.362">傍晚的风</span> <span begin="0:39.362" end="0:40.194">替我们指</span><span begin="0:40.194" end="0: